ss="FadeInUp_container___uxva" data-fill="false"><div class="Values_textInner__wGqhx"><p class="Values_numbers__NEvs6">0<!-- -->3<!-- -->/</p><h3 class="Values_rowHeading__it43_" style="background-color:#d7e1d3">Think Diversely</h3><p class="Values_mainText__6L_mW">We embrace how varied life is. Whether it’s the clients and industries we work in, our interests and inspiration, or our attitudes to life in general. </p></div></span></div><div class="Values_images__U0Ihs"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><figure class="Values_image1__z_VE0"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/culture-row-3.jpg 1086w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/culture-row-3-479x500.jpg 479w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/culture-row-3-768x802.jpg 768w" data-src="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/culture-row-3.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1134" width="1086" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></figure></span></div></div><div class="Values_row__LSBU8"><div class="Values_text__E_Yae"><span class="FadeInUp_container___uxva" data-fill="false"><div class="Values_textInner__wGqhx"><p class="Values_numbers__NEvs6">0<!-- -->4<!-- -->/</p><h3 class="Values_rowHeading__it43_" style="background-color:#f8e5cb">Leave No Crumbs</h3><p class="Values_mainText__6L_mW">Good is the enemy of great. We strive for the best, we give a shit, and care about what we do. We don’t cut corners, every pixel matters. We don’t leave it for someone else to tidy up, we leave no crumbs.</p></div></span></div><div class="Values_images__U0Ihs"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><figure class="Values_image1__z_VE0"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/culture-row-4.jpg 1086w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/1